{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：S08—S11等短停留段的感受线索仍然偏密，尤其在音乐快速变化时，观众可能来不及兼顾文字和聆听。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y虽然信息更密，但【】突出叙事关键，感受文字的层级较低，带有时间标记的内容又能跟随音乐出现，因此观众更容易抓住人物每一阶段的心理变化，并把音乐的具体变化与故事联系起来。X的双栏布局更方便快速扫读，但右侧感受往往是并列标签，缺少音乐发展中的先后关系，部分情绪也比较概括。总体而言，Y让人物的矛盾、怀念、动摇和最终选择形成了更完整、更细腻的体验，局部阅读负担是它最明显的代价。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "073f3a10-f767-4cad-8bef-5cf1d32916a1", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T172513657222Z", "elapsed_seconds": 88.421, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T17:26:42.090195+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "70f618f47e998258cc17b85a832c354e01febf6728f65761d818b2c19d515f43", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_we